        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, production DZ, at evaporation plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, production DZ, at evaporation plant
The process is normalized on the gaseous form of gas.;
3c5b7ff5-19ed-377b-a2a3-46617770e7c4
This dataset describes the gasification of Algerian natural gas in a European evaporation plant.
Location:  Global data for energy requirements combined with country-specific natural gas characteristics.
Technology: European technology average.
Time period: Data on energy use for the liquefaction stems of a review of common technologies from 2017 and 2019.
Production volume: none
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3c5b7ff5-19ed-377b-a2a3-46617770e7c4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
